    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not the same though. \"quiet courage\" sounds like something you say to someone who just needs to get over it. but it's not about being brave, it's about the fact that there's no point in the effort if the outcome is always going to be mediocre. a life of just being \"okay\" and \"contributing a tiny bit\" feels like a much slower, more painful way to die than anything else. why go through the decades of being nothing special?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
